---
description: Test conventions for this repo (vitest, jsdom, snapshots).
globs: ["**/*.test.{ts,tsx}", "**/tests/**", "**/__tests__/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tests

- Tests run on vitest with jsdom. `describe`, `it`, `expect`, and `vi` are GLOBALS
  (configured via `types: ["vitest/globals"]`) — do not import them.
- Co-locate tests as `<file>.test.ts(x)` next to the source, or in the package's
  `tests/` / `__tests__/` directory. Follow the nearest existing example.
- Do not hand-edit snapshot files. Regenerate with `yarn test:update` and review the diff
  before committing.
- Run a focused test with `yarn test <path-or-name>` while iterating.
